@* Ko-fi's donation form, on every page. The footer's Support link opens it; the page script loads
   the form on the first open only, so Ko-fi isn't contacted until someone asks for it. *@
<dialog class="modal modal-support" id="support-modal" aria-labelledby="support-title">
    <div class="support-top">
        <h2 class="heading" id="support-title">Support Astro Claus</h2>
        <button type="button" class="icon-button" aria-label="Close" data-close-modal>
            <span class="icon icon-x" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
    </div>
    <p class="caption muted support-note">Every donation goes to keeping this site online: its hosting and the storage for your letters. That's how writing to Santa stays free.</p>
    <iframe title="Support Astro Claus on Ko-fi" data-src="https://ko-fi.com/ajuarez/?hidefeed=true&widget=true&embed=true&preview=true"></iframe>
</dialog>
